### Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:5035/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jason.kub",
  "password": "pass"
}

### Exact ID match (should return 1 customer)
GET http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/1/customers/find?query=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Partial-digit phone (should 404 now, not match everyone)
GET http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/1/customers/find?query=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Exact phone (should match the customer with that number)
GET http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/1/customers/find?query=09790849413
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Exact ID that doesn't exist but the number parses (should fall through to phone, likely 404)
GET http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/1/customers/find?query=999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

